      "changes": 3,
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/contents/docs_new%2Fdocs%2Fget-started%2Finstall.mdx?ref=5983d7b4135e66dbe9d662717f2b6087bcaad7e2",
      "deletions": 1,
      "filename": "docs_new/docs/get-started/install.mdx",
      "patch": "@@ -237,5 +237,6 @@ echo \"Build and push completed successfully!\"\n \n ## Common Notes\n \n-- [FlashInfer](https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer) is the default attention kernel backend. It only supports sm75 and above. If you encounter any FlashInfer-related issues on sm75+ devices (e.g., T4, A10, A100, L4, L40S, H100), please switch to other kernels by adding `--attention-backend triton --sampling-backend pytorch` and open an issue on GitHub.\n+- [FlashInfer](https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer) is the default attention kernel backend. It only supports sm75+ devices. If you encounter any FlashInfer-related issues on sm75+ devices (e.g., A10, A100, L4, L40S, H100), please switch to other kernels by adding `--attention-backend triton --sampling-backend pytorch` and open an issue on GitHub.\n+- sm75 devices are no longer supported. (Refer to [#6006](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/issues/6006))\n - To reinstall flashinfer locally, use the following command: `pip3 install --upgrade flashinfer-python --force-reinstall --no-deps` and then delete the cache with `rm -rf ~/.cache/flashinfer`.",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/raw/5983d7b4135e66dbe9d662717f2b6087bcaad7e2/docs_new%2Fdocs%2Fget-started%2Finstall.mdx",
